ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Art Nouveau
Board: /styles/art-nouveau
Companions: art-nouveau-starter.html, art-nouveau-study.ai, art-nouveau-study.psd

Document
2400 × 3400 px. Paper #f6f1e4.

Layer stack
- Caption, one line
- Empty medallion (two stroked circles, no fill image)
- Rose curve
- Green vine
- Gold border
- Paper

Strokes are vector or clean shape layers, not a traced poster.
The medallion stays empty. That is the point of the starter.
